# Draft:List of awards and nominations received by FyaVerse

}}Jamaican artist FyaVerse has earned significant recognition throughout his career, which began with his collaboration with Chevobeatz on the track Shatta Gyal that was charted on the Billboard Argentina Hot 100, but it was with 'Time's Dread.' FyaVerse received a notable nomination at the HDP Music Award for their work on the song, marking his first major recognition in the industry.
